<title>USA: TABLE - Mirage Resorts sells 2-part debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Mirage Resorts sells 2-part debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from Mirage Resorts Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER MIRAGE RESORTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.547  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.813 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +80 BPS    MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT +20</p>
<p>						 BPS OVER U.S. TREASURIES</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2017</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.695  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 7.279 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +95 BPS    MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT +25</p>
<p>						 BPS OVER U.S. TREASURIES</p>
<p>((Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
